# Lemniscate environment variables.
#
# Lemniscate is local-first and client-only. NO server-side environment
# variables are required. The application works fully without any .env file.
#
# Online AI is BYOK (Bring Your Own Key): the user pastes their OpenRouter
# API key directly into Settings → AI companions. The key is stored in
# memory only (session-scoped) — never in localStorage, IndexedDB, or
# server environment variables. Closing the browser tab clears the key.
#
# There is NO server-side AI proxy. The browser calls OpenRouter directly.
#
# If you want to understand the key format, OpenRouter keys start with
# sk-or-v1-... and can be created at https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# This file is intentionally empty — it exists only to document that
# no environment variables are needed.
